Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(3d): match adaptive air-entry note to tool entry law

Only emit the air-entry note for a centre-cutting tool, matching the
ladder condition. Pin both tool settings without changing motions.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2468
